---
// Philosophy.astro — Stoic philosophy section with principles
---

<section class="relative section-gap bg-stoa-surface">
  <div class="container-stoa text-center">
    <!-- Section Label -->
    <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-sm text-caption font-body font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-stoa-accent mb-xl">
      <span class="block w-4 h-px bg-stoa-accent"></span>
      The Stoa Approach
    </p>

    <!-- Title -->
    <h2 class="font-display font-normal text-title mb-xl max-w-[700px] mx-auto">
      Built on 2,000 years<br />of focused thought.
    </h2>

    <!-- Stoic Quote -->
    <blockquote class="mb-lg max-w-[600px] mx-auto">
      <span class="text-stoa-accent text-[40px] font-display font-light italic leading-none select-none">&ldquo;</span>
      <p class="font-display font-light italic text-[28px] leading-snug text-stoa-muted mt-sm">
        Confine yourself to the present.
      </p>
      <cite class="block font-body font-light text-[15px] text-stoa-dim mt-sm not-italic">
        &mdash; Marcus Aurelius
      </cite>
    </blockquote>

    <!-- Body -->
    <p class="font-body font-light text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-stoa-muted max-w-[560px] mx-auto mb-3xl">
      The Stoics didn't fight chaos — they ignored it.
      Stoa is built around that same principle: instead of organizing
      everything, focus on what matters right now, today.
      One day. Five tasks. Full presence.
    </p>

    <!-- Three Principles -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-2xl max-w-[800px] mx-auto">
      <!-- I. Control -->
      <div data-animate data-animate-delay="0" class="text-left md:text-center">
        <p class="font-display font-light italic text-[40px] text-stoa-accent mb-sm">I.</p>
        <h3 class="font-body font-medium text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-stoa-text mb-sm">Control</h3>
        <p class="font-body font-light text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-stoa-muted max-w-[240px] mx-auto">
          Only what you choose enters your day. Everything else waits in The Vault.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- II. Presence -->
      <div data-animate data-animate-delay="80" class="text-left md:text-center md:border-x md:border-stoa-border md:px-2xl pt-xl md:pt-0 border-t border-stoa-border md:border-t-0">
        <p class="font-display font-light italic text-[40px] text-stoa-accent mb-sm">II.</p>
        <h3 class="font-body font-medium text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-stoa-text mb-sm">Presence</h3>
        <p class="font-body font-light text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-stoa-muted max-w-[240px] mx-auto">
          One task at a time. Focus Mode locks the world out so you can go deep.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- III. Reflection -->
      <div data-animate data-animate-delay="160" class="text-left md:text-center pt-xl md:pt-0 border-t border-stoa-border md:border-t-0">
        <p class="font-display font-light italic text-[40px] text-stoa-accent mb-sm">III.</p>
        <h3 class="font-body font-medium text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-stoa-text mb-sm">Reflection</h3>
        <p class="font-body font-light text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-stoa-muted max-w-[240px] mx-auto">
          Each evening, review. Each morning, begin again with clarity.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
